                        "form": "нае́здах"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ea785d91-b1fe-3033-b393-4a7f98bfb5c7",
                        "entry_id": "8b63f5af-278d-3517-a723-b66b18fc7b2c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "действие по значению гл. наезжать, наехать; проезд колёсами по чему-либо"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1c6fd841-b0ef-433d-b512-02a9ecb045c7",
                                "sense_id": "ea785d91-b1fe-3033-b393-4a7f98bfb5c7",
                                "text": "Наезд на пешехода."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fe1bb692-d5e0-48b8-bc0f-e04d0f78a75d",
                                "sense_id": "ea785d91-b1fe-3033-b393-4a7f98bfb5c7",
                                "text": "Перед самым наездом на «лежачего полицейского» нужно отпустить тормоз."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a7e7ba68-74bd-3c26-80a5-95c4b5a414d8",
                        "entry_id": "8b63f5af-278d-3517-a723-b66b18fc7b2c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "приезд множества людей"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8d8b6d44-b6f3-4bc5-964c-5c2a5ac4b5ba",
                                "sense_id": "a7e7ba68-74bd-3c26-80a5-95c4b5a414d8",
                                "text": "наезд гостей"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a1abce2d-44d6-3f54-b892-440afe95da1c",
                        "entry_id": "8b63f5af-278d-3517-a723-b66b18fc7b2c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "приезд кого-либо на непродолжительное время"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "abae2deb-8002-4c0e-aacf-3685fb179c66",
                                "sense_id": "a1abce2d-44d6-3f54-b892-440afe95da1c",
                                "text": "За пять лет между моими наездами русских в Копенгагене стало больше, и они изменились."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b86410d3-7421-3ab1-b346-8de273e0a934",
                        "entry_id": "8b63f5af-278d-3517-a723-b66b18fc7b2c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "истор. способ исполнения решения суда в старом польском законодательстве, вооружённое нападение с целью отъёма собственности"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0f8db8d9-311f-4992-bb0e-ca6342a12f13",
                                "sense_id": "b86410d3-7421-3ab1-b346-8de273e0a934",
                                "text": "«Пан Тадеуш, или последний наезд в Литве. Шляхетская история 1811–1812 годов в двенадцати книгах, писанная стихами»"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "861d84ee-d51a-3ce8-a6fe-7fc1269aac3c",
                        "entry_id": "8b63f5af-278d-3517-a723-b66b18fc7b2c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "жарг. крим. нападение или посягательство на чьи-либо интересы"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fa62e6da-a4ce-4157-8c2f-dc2191188eeb",
                                "sense_id": "861d84ee-d51a-3ce8-a6fe-7fc1269aac3c",
                                "text": "Варварский «наезд» на ЮКОС — результат того, что Ходорковский решил порвать с круговой порукой олигархов, перестать заглядывать Кремлю в рот."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c7415f3f-68a7-3ffa-a4e9-deb467f1839e",
                        "entry_id": "8b63f5af-278d-3517-a723-b66b18fc7b2c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "кино увеличение изображения при фото- и киносъёмке изменением фокусного расстояния объектива или приближением камеры к объекту"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fd78d6cf-7240-35f3-9a15-64cafe902c11",
                        "entry_id": "8b63f5af-278d-3517-a723-b66b18fc7b2c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "жарг. нападки на кого-либо"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cc9bafea-2b44-407e-a958-68ab29f5cf40",
                                "sense_id": "fd78d6cf-7240-35f3-9a15-64cafe902c11",
                                "text": "После простодушных, искренних признаний телеведущего в нелюбви к творчеству известного писателя на него начался наезд в прессе со стороны поклонников мастера."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4aaa8f5a-01d1-47ae-b49c-fe5bf6fd2735",
                        "source_entry_id": "8b63f5af-278d-3517-a723-b66b18fc7b2c",
                        "source_sense_description": "дорожно-транспортное происшествие",
                        "target_lang_word": "Auffahren",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0aefe0ef-4237-45a8-bfd3-c9728b2b0157",
                        "source_entry_id": "8b63f5af-278d-3517-a723-b66b18fc7b2c",
                        "source_sense_description": "угрозы, жёсткие требования",
                        "target_lang_word": "shakedown",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "shakedown",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bf8901d0-3bce-3edf-9119-a065e6a4f926",
                                        "entry_id": "d5e877f8-e784-3aee-9de3-790a8664bd62",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Extortion, especially through blackmail"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a31c55e1-d2fa-4ee8-a934-a04ce60c93d4",
                                                "sense_id": "bf8901d0-3bce-3edf-9119-a065e6a4f926",
                                                "text": "What is this, a shakedown?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8f3a8c26-7269-47f2-b5cb-3a665ec58b26",
                                                "sense_id": "bf8901d0-3bce-3edf-9119-a065e6a4f926",
                                                "text": "Four Thai police officers charged with murder in connection with the deadly shakedown of a suspected drug dealer in custody were arrested Wednesday after a video clip of the incident shared on social media caused a public furor."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0266dc50-9478-36af-8bb8-c484250d3a55",
                                        "entry_id": "d5e877f8-e784-3aee-9de3-790a8664bd62",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A thorough search; a frisk"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f159fa02-31d1-3e18-b986-b96ba155ca42",
                                        "entry_id": "d5e877f8-e784-3aee-9de3-790a8664bd62",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A trial or test period, especially of a ship or aircraft."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f0dbb208-383d-4c46-96c1-78ed3ed28d01",
                                                "sense_id": "f159fa02-31d1-3e18-b986-b96ba155ca42",
                                                "text": "It was planning to use an '807' for one day only as part of a shakedown test, ahead of the fleet's formal entry to service which is currently planned for November."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d8f3b203-9c8b-3b79-b09f-1ba95754d957",
                                        "entry_id": "d5e877f8-e784-3aee-9de3-790a8664bd62",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An improvised bed."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "330058d8-5f2b-4a11-a594-def0de82b333",
                                                "sense_id": "d8f3b203-9c8b-3b79-b09f-1ba95754d957",
                                                "text": "All sorts of gossip floated about; one story told was that a selector, and not the youngest of that staid and sober party, was found putting his boots into his shakedown at night, and lying outside the entrance of his tent, giving careful directions to some one to call him in time for the morning mail."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b4b4f8bb-c1be-4104-a575-a97e4d0a32c0",
                                                "sense_id": "d8f3b203-9c8b-3b79-b09f-1ba95754d957",
                                                "text": "\"There's nowhere for me to lie down, sir,\" he answered, and there was in his voice a humbleness which was very distressing. -- \"Don't you know anyone in the house who'll give you a shakedown?\" -- \"No, sir.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a475c7ca-bfc5-4a18-bf23-c0fe67cfb50a",
                                                "sense_id": "d8f3b203-9c8b-3b79-b09f-1ba95754d957",
                                                "text": "‘You two,’ he says, ‘you're not going back tonight. […] I can make you shake-downs on the veranda and we'll have a bite to eat.’"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
